Team Management in Taskip is a structured system designed to help you organize users, control access, and manage collaboration within your workspace. It combines Teams, Members, and Role Permissions into a unified system.

## Purpose

- Organize users into structured teams
- Manage internal and external members
- Control access using role-based permissions
- Improve collaboration and workflow efficiency

## Core Components

- Teams
- Members
- Role Permissions

## Summary

Team Management ensures your workspace remains organized, scalable, and secure by defining how users collaborate and access system features.
